          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ant is a gym with five disciplines under one roof. On paper that's a list of services — but people stay here because of the room, not the schedule. One ant is small; a colony moves what's bigger than itself. A fighter knows this: you step into the ring alone, but it's the gym that got you there."
